1. C\f1\'e3n c\f2\lang1066\u7913? \f1\'d0i\f2\u7873?u 8, Lu\u7853?t Giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?, h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi n\'e0o sau \f1\'f0\f0\'e2y b\f2\lang1066\u7883? nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam c\f2\lang1066\u7845?m?\par
A) \f1\'d0i\f2\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe c\f1\u417? gi\f2\u7899?i kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\'f3 gi\f2\lang1066\u7845?y ph\f0\lang1033\'e9p l\'e1i xe theo quy \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh\par
B) Giao xe c\f1\u417? gi\f2\u7899?i, xe m\f0\lang1033\'e1y chuy\'ean d\'f9ng cho ng\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?i kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7911? \f1\'f0i\f2\u7873?u ki\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033 i\f2\lang1066\u7873?\f0\lang1033 u khi\f2\lang1066\u7875?n xe tham gia giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897? \par
C) \f1\'d0i\f2\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe c\f1\u417? gi\f2\u7899?i ch\u7841?y qu\f0\lang1033\'e1 t\f2\lang1066\u7889?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7897? quy \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh, gi\f0\lang1033\'e0nh \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng, v\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?t \u7849?u\par
\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\'e0nh vi \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c n\u7871?u\par
\b0 2. C\f1\'e3n c\f2\u7913? \f1\'d0i\f2\u7873?u 8, Lu\u7853?t Giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?, h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi n\'e0o sau \f1\'f0\f0\'e2y b\f2\lang1066\u7883? nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam c\f2\lang1066\u7845?m?\par
A) \f1\'d0ua xe, \f0\lang1033 c\f2\lang1066\u7893?\f0\lang1033  v\f1\u361? \'f0ua xe, t\f2\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c \f1\'f0ua xe tr\f0\lang1033\'e1i ph\'e9p, l\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e1ch, \f1\'f0\f0\'e1nh v\'f5ng\par
B) \f1\'d0i\f2\lang1066\u7873?u khi\u7875?n ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng ti\f2\u7879?n giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897? m\f0\lang1033\'e0 trong c\f1\u417? th\f2\lang1066\u7875? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 ch\f2\lang1066\u7845?t ma t\f0\lang1033\'fay\par
C) \f1\'d0i\f2\lang1066\u7873?u khi\u7875?n xe \f0\lang1033\'f4 t\'f4\f2\lang1066 , m\f0\lang1033\'e1y k\'e9o, xe m\'e1y chuy\'ean d\'f9ng tr\'ean \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng m\f0\lang1033\'e0 trong m\'e1u ho\f2\lang1066\u7863?c h\f1\u417?i th\f2\u7903? c\f0\lang1033\'f3 n\f2\lang1066\u7891?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7897? c\u7891?n\par
\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\'e0nh vi \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c n\f0\lang1033\'eau\par
\b0 3. C\f1\'e3n c\f2\lang1066\u7913? \f1\'d0i\f2\u7873?u 8, Lu\u7853?t Giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?, h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh vi n\'e0o sau \f1\'f0\f0\'e2y b\f2\lang1066\u7883? nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam c\f2\lang1066\u7845?m?\par
A) L\u7855?p \f1\'f0\f2\u7863?t, s\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f2i, \f1\'f0\f0\'e8n kh\'f4ng \f1\'f0\f0\'fang thi\f2\lang1066\u7871?t k\u7871? c\u7911?a nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 s\f2\lang1066\u7843?n xu\u7845?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i v\u7899?i t\u7915?ng lo\u7841?i xe c\f1\u417? gi\f2\u7899?i; s\u7917? d\u7909?ng thi\u7871?t b\u7883? \f0\lang1033\'e2m thanh g\'e2y m\f2\lang1066\u7845?t tr\u7853?t t\u7921? an to\f0\lang1033\'e0n giao th\'f4ng, tr\f2\lang1066\u7853?t t\u7921? c\u7895?ng c\u7897?ng\par
B) B\u7845?\f0\lang1033 m \f2\lang1066 c\f0\lang1033\'f2i, r\'fa ga li\'ean t\f2\lang1066\u7909?c; b\u7845?m c\f0\lang1033\'f2i trong th\f2\lang1066\u7901?i gian t\u7915? 22 gi\u7901? \f1\'f0\f2\u7871?n 5 gi\u7901?, b\u7845?m c\f0\lang1033\'f2i h\f1\u417?i, s\f2\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e8n chi\f2\lang1066\u7871?u xa trong \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f4 th\f2\lang1066\u7883? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 khu \f1\'f0\f0\'f4ng d\'e2n c\f1\u432?, tr\f2\lang1066\u7915? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c xe \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c quy\u7873?n \f1\u432?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean \f1\'f0ang \'f0i l\f0\'e0m nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? theo quy \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh\par
C) \f1\'d0\lang1033\u432?\f0 a\f2\lang1066  xe c\f1\u417? gi\f2\u7899?i, xe m\f0\lang1033\'e1y chuy\'ean d\'f9ng kh\'f4ng b\f2\lang1066\u7843?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7843?m ti\f0\lang1033\'eau chu\f2\lang1066\u7849?n an to\f0\lang1033\'e0n k\f2\lang1066\u7929? thu\u7853?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0 b\f2\lang1066\u7843?o v\u7879? m\f0\lang1033\'f4i tr\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng tham gia giao th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng b\u7897?\par
\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\'e0nh vi \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c n\f0\lang1033\'eau\par
\b0 4.s\f2\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\f0\lang1033\'e1c v\f2\lang1066\u7853?t d\u7909?ng k\f0\lang1033\'e8m theo (t\'fai nilong, \f2\lang1066\u7889?ng h\f0\lang1033\'fat nh\f2\lang1066\u7921?a, \f1\'f0\f2\u7891? khuy\u7871?n m\f0\lang1033\'e3i,...) khi kh\'f4ng c\f2\lang1066\u7847?n thi\u7871?t\par
A) Gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u\par
\b B) T\u7915? ch\u7889?i \par
\b0 C) Tranh th\u7911?\par
D) Khuy\u7871?n kh\f0\lang1033\'edch\par
5. \ldblquote\f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050", \'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 d\f2\lang1066\u7921?a tr\f0\lang1033\'ean c\f1\'e3n c\f2\lang1066\u7913? nh\u7919?ng v\f1\'e3n b\f2\u7843?n n\f0\lang1033\'e0o sau \f1\'f0\f0\'e2y?\par
A) Lu\f2\lang1066\u7853?t Quy ho\u7841?ch\par
B) Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t \f1\'d0\f2\u7841?i h\u7897?i XIII c\u7911?a \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng, Chi\u7871?n l\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n kinh t\u7871? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021-2030\par
C) C\f0\lang1033\'e1c ngh\f2\lang1066\u7883? quy\u7871?t, k\u7871?t lu\u7853?n c\u7911?a BCHTW \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng, B\u7897? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f2\lang1066\u7883?, Qu\u7889?c h\u7897?i... v\u7873? ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n kinh t\u7871? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i \f1\'f0\f2\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 6 v\'f9ng kinh t\f2\lang1066\u7871? trong th\u7901?i k\u7923? m\u7899?i\par
\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? n\u7897?i dung \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau\par
\b0\lang9 6. \ldblquote\f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050" x\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh r\u7857?ng, sau h\f1\u417?n 35 n\'e3m \'f0\f2\u7893?i m\u7899?i, qu\f0\lang1033\'e1 tr\'ecnh ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f2\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng kinh t\u7871? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i, qu\u7889?c ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng - an ninh v\'e0 b\f2\lang1066\u7843?o v\u7879? m\f0\lang1033\'f4i tr\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng tr\f0\lang1033\'ean l\'e3nh\par
 A) Ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng, li\'ean k\f2\lang1066\u7871?t v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng chuy\f2\lang1066\u7875?n bi\u7871?n t\f0\lang1033\'edch c\f2\lang1066\u7921?c, h\f0\lang1033\'ecnh th\'e0nh nhi\f2\lang1066\u7873?u v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng kinh t\f2\lang1066\u7871? l\u7899?n, quan tr\u7885?ng cho ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c \par
B) B\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7847?u h\f0\lang1033\'ecnh th\'e0nh c\'e1c h\'e0nh lang kinh t\f2\lang1066\u7871? tr\f0\lang1033\'ean \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?a b\f0\lang1033\'e0n c\'e1c v\'f9ng, li\'ean v\'f9ng, nh\f2\lang1066\u7845?t l\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1c h\'e0nh lang g\f2\lang1066\u7855?n v\u7899?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0\f0\'f4 th\f2\lang1066\u7883? l\u7899?n \par
C) Kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian \f1\'f0\f0\'f4 th\f2\lang1066\u7883? \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c m\u7903? r\u7897?ng, d\u7851?n h\f0\lang1033\'ecnh th\'e0nh m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng l\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?i \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f4 th\f2\lang1066\u7883?, g\f0\lang1033\'f3p ph\f2\lang1066\u7847?n t\u7841?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng l\u7921?c cho t\f1\'e3ng tr\u432?\f2\u7903?ng kinh t\u7871? \par
\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? n\u7897?i dung \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau\par
\b0 7. \ldblquote\f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050\rdblquote  x\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh r\u7857?ng, sau h\f1\u417?n 35 n\'e3m \'f0\f2\u7893?i m\u7899?i, qu\f0\lang1033\'e1 tr\'ecnh ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f2\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng kinh t\u7871? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i, qu\u7889?c ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng - an ninh v\'e0 b\f2\lang1066\u7843?o v\u7879? m\f0\lang1033\'f4i tr\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng tr\f0\lang1033\'ean l\'e3nh\par
 A) \f1\'d0\f0\'e3 h\'ecnh th\'e0nh m\f2\lang1066\u7897?t s\u7889? v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng s\f2\lang1066\u7843?n xu\u7845?t t\u7853?p trung quy m\f0\lang1033\'f4 l\f2\lang1066\u7899?n thu\u7897?c c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ng\'e0nh, l\f1\u297?nh v\f2\lang1066\u7921?c quan tr\u7885?ng\par
B) C\f0\lang1033\'e1c v\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?n qu\u7889?c gia, khu b\u7843?o t\u7891?n thi\f0\lang1033\'ean nhi\'ean... \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c quan t\f0\lang1033\'e2m b\f2\lang1066\u7843?o v\u7879?, m\u7903? r\u7897?ng, g\f0\lang1033\'f3p ph\f2\lang1066\u7847?n t\f1\'e3ng \'f0a d\f2\u7841?ng sinh h\u7885?c\par
C) H\u7879? th\u7889?ng k\u7871?t c\u7845?u h\u7841? t\u7847?ng \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c quan t\f0\lang1033\'e2m x\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng, t\u7841?o di\u7879?n m\u7841?o m\u7899?i cho \f1\'f0\f2\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c\par
\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? n\u7897?i dung \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau\par
\b0 8. \ldblquote\f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050" \'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7873? ra nh\u7919?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh h\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?ng quy ho\u7841?ch g\f0\lang1033\'ec ?\f2\lang1066\par
A) \f1\'d0\f2\u7883?nh h\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian kinh t\f2\lang1066\u7871? - x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i\par
B) \f1\'d0\f2\u7883?nh h\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian bi\f2\lang1066\u7875?n\par
C) \f1\'d0\f2\u7883?nh h\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?ng s\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7845?t qu\u7889?c gia\par
\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c n\f2\lang1066\u7897?i dung \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\f2\lang1066\u7871?u\par
\b0 9. \ldblquote\f1\'d0\f2\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050", \'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 ch\f2\lang1066\u7881? ra nguy\f0\lang1033\'ean nh\'e2n ch\f2\lang1066\u7911? y\u7871?u c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\f2\lang1066\u7841?n ch\u7871?, b\u7845?t c\u7853?p trong t\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c giai \f1\'f0o\f2\u7841?n v\u7915?a qua. \f1\'d0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 do...\par
