\b0 B) Ti\f2\lang1066\u7871?t ki\u7879?m gi\u7845?y in v\f1\'e3n ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng\par
C) S\f2\lang1066\u7889? ho\f0\lang1033\'e1 c\'e1c v\f1\'e3n b\f2\lang1066\u7843?n\par
D) T\u7863?ng s\f0\lang1033\'e1ch/ t\'e0i li\f2\lang1066\u7879?u cho ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c khi c\'f2n d\'f9ng \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c.\par
29. C\f1\'e3n c\f2\u7913? \f1\'d0i\f2\u7873?u 4, B\u7897? Quy t\u7855?c \u7913?ng x\u7917? tr\f0\lang1033\'ean m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i, \f1\'f0i\f2\u7873?u g\f0\lang1033\'ec m\'e0 t\f2\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1 nh\'e2n n\'ean th\f2\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n?\par
A) T\f0\lang1033\'ecm hi\f2\lang1066\u7875?u v\f0\lang1033\'e0 tu\'e2n th\f2\lang1066\u7911? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0i\f2\lang1066\u7873?u kho\u7843?n h\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?ng d\u7851?n s\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\u7911?a nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 cung c\f2\lang1066\u7845?p d\u7883?ch v\u7909? m\u7841?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i tr\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c khi \f1\'f0\'e3ng k\f0\lang1033\'fd, tham gia m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i.\par
B) C\f0\lang1033\'f3 c\'e1c h\'e0nh vi, \f2\lang1066\u7913?ng x\u7917? ph\f0\lang1033\'f9 h\f2\lang1066\u7907?p v\u7899?i nh\u7919?ng gi\f0\lang1033\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7913?c, v\f1\'e3n h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, truy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n th\u7889?ng c\u7911?a d\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\f2\lang1066\u7897?c Vi\u7879?t Nam.\par
C) Chia s\u7867? nh\u7919?ng th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng tin c\'f3 ngu\f2\lang1066\u7891?n ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh th\f2\lang1066\u7889?ng, \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1ng tin c\f2\lang1066\u7853?y.\par
\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c quy t\f2\lang1066\u7855?c \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau.\par
\b0 30. \ldblquote\f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050\rdblquote , \'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau c\'e1c h\f2\lang1066\u7841?n ch\u7871?, b\u7845?t c\u7853?p trong\par
