31. "\f1\'d0\f2\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7871? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050" \'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 r\'fat ra b\'e0i h\f2\lang1066\u7885?c kinh nghi\u7879?m g\f0\lang1033\'ec qua vi\f2\lang1066\u7879?c \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1nh gi\'e1 th\f2\lang1066\u7921?c tr\u7841?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f2\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c giai \f1\'f0o\f2\u7841?n v\u7915?a qua\f0\lang1033  ?\f2\lang1066\par
A) Ch\f1\u432?a h\f0\lang1033\'ecnh th\'e0nh \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c c\f0\lang1033\'e1c trung t\'e2m t\'e0i ch\'ednh l\f2\lang1066\u7899?n; vi\u7879?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'e1c khu kinh t\f2\lang1066\u7871?, khu c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p, khu du l\u7883?ch c\f0\lang1033\'f2n d\'e0n tr\f2\lang1066\u7843?i, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843?\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang1066 ch\f1\u432?a cao\par
B) Thi\f2\u7871?u quy ho\u7841?ch mang t\f0\lang1033\'ednh t\f2\lang1066\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia, d\f0\lang1033\'e0i h\f2\lang1066\u7841?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? x\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh r\f0\lang1033\'f5 m\'f4 h\'ecnh ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n theo kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian l\'e3nh th\f2\lang1066\u7893? tr\f0\lang1033\'ean ph\f2\lang1066\u7841?m vi c\u7843? n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c\par
\b C) Vi\u7879?c huy \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng, s\u7917? d\u7909?ng ngu\u7891?n l\u7921?c ph\u7843?i x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd h\'e0i h\'f2a m\f2\lang1066\u7889?i quan h\u7879? gi\u7919?a ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'e2n b\f2\lang1066\u7857?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 tr\f2\lang1066\u7885?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e2m, tr\f2\lang1066\u7885?ng \f1\'f0i\f2\u7875?m, ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t huy l\f2\lang1066\u7907?i th\u7871? c\u7841?nh tranh t\u7915?ng v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng, t\f2\lang1066\u7841?o \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c c\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897?ng l\u7921?c, \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?t ph\f0\lang1033\'e1 ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n\b0\par
D) Ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng \f1\'f0\f0\'e3 c\'f3 b\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7899?c chuy\u7875?n bi\u7875?n, h\f0\lang1033\'ecnh th\'e0nh nhi\f2\lang1066\u7873?u v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng kinh t\f2\lang1066\u7871? l\u7899?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 vai tr\'f2 quan tr\f2\lang1066\u7885?ng trong ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c\par
32. C\f1\'e3n c\f2\u7913? \f1\'d0i\f2\u7873?u 4, B\u7897? Quy t\u7855?c \u7913?ng x\u7917? tr\f0\lang1033\'ean m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i, quy t\u7855?c l\f0\lang1033\'e0nh m\f2\lang1066\u7841?nh l\f0\lang1033\'e0\par
A) Tu\'e2n th\f2\lang1066\u7911? ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f2\lang1066\u7853?t Vi\u7879?t Nam, t\u7891?n trong quy\u7873?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 l\f2\lang1066\u7907?i \f0\lang1033\'edch h\f2\lang1066\u7907?p ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a t\u7893? ch\u7913?c, c\f0\lang1033\'e1 nh\'e2n.\par
\b B) H\'e0nh vi, \f2\lang1066\u7913?ng x\u7917? tr\f0\lang1033\'ean m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i ph\f0\lang1033\'f9 h\f2\lang1066\u7907?p v\u7899?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1c gi\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7913?c, v\f1\'e3n h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, truy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n th\u7889?ng t\u7889?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7865?p c\u7911?a d\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\f2\lang1066\u7897?c Vi\u7879?t Nam.\par
\b0 C) Tu\f0\lang1033\'e2n th\f2\lang1066\u7911? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c quy \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh v\f0\lang1033\'e0 h\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7899?ng d\u7851?n v\u7873? b\u7843?o v\u7879? an to\f0\lang1033\'e0n v\'e0 b\f2\lang1066\u7843?o m\u7853?t th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng tin.\par
D) Ch\f2\lang1066\u7883?u tr\f0\lang1033\'e1ch nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7873? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\'e0nh vi, \f2\lang1066\u7913?ng x\u7917? tr\f0\lang1033\'ean m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i; ph\u7889?i h\u7907?p v\u7899?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\f1\u417? quan ch\f2\lang1066\u7913?c n\f1\'e3ng \'f0\f2\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd h\'e0nh vi, n\f2\lang1066\u7897?i dung th\f0\lang1033\'f4ng tin v\'ec ph\f2\lang1066\u7841?m ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p lu\f2\lang1066\u7853?t.\par
