C) Th\u7901?i gian ph\f0\lang1033\'e2n hu\f2\lang1066\u7927? t\u7921? nhi\f0\lang1033\'ean c\'f3 th\f2\lang1066\u7875? r\u7845?t l\f0\lang1033\'e2u (l\'ean t\f2\lang1066\u7899?i tr\f1\'e3m ho\f2\u7863?c tri\u7879?u n\f1\'e3m) nh\u432?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f3 th\f2\lang1066\u7875? g\u7917?i cho c\f0\lang1033\'e1c nh\'e0 m\'e1y \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7875? x\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd v\'e0 s\f2\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng l\u7841?i \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c. D) L\f0\lang1033\'e0 ch\f2\lang1066\u7845?t th\u7843?i ch\u7913?a y\u7871?u t\u7889? \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?c h\u7841?i, ph\f0\lang1033\'f3ng x\f2\lang1066\u7841?, l\f0\lang1033\'e2y nhi\f2\lang1066\u7877?m, d\u7877? ch\f0\lang1033\'e1y, d\f2\lang1066\u7877? n\u7893?, g\f0\lang1033\'e2y \f1\'e3n m\f0\'f2n, g\'e2y ng\f2\lang1066\u7897? \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?c ho\u7863?c c\f0\lang1033\'f3 \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7863?c t\f0\lang1033\'ednh nguy h\f2\lang1066\u7841?i kh\f0\lang1033\'e1c\par
45. \f1\'d0\f0\'e1nh gi\'e1 th\f2\lang1066\u7921?c tr\u7841?ng ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f2\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c giai \f1\'f0o\f2\u7841?n v\u7915?a qua, \ldblquote\f1\'d0\f2\u7873? \f0\lang1033\'e1n quy ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050" r\f0\lang1033\'fat ra m\f2\lang1066\u7897?t s\u7889? b\f0\lang1033\'e0i h\f2\lang1066\u7885?c kinh nghi\u7879?m. \f1\'d0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 g\'ec ?\par
