\b B) Ph\u7843?i coi tr\u7885?ng c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c ho\'e0n thi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n th\u7875? ch\u7871? v\u7873? t\u7893? ch\u7913?c l\u7853?p, qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd v\'e0 th\f2\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n quy ho\u7841?ch\par
\b0 C) \f1\'d0\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\'ecnh th\'e0nh m\f2\lang1066\u7897?t s\u7889? v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng s\f2\lang1066\u7843?n xu\u7845?t t\u7853?p trung quy m\f0\lang1033\'f4 l\f2\lang1066\u7899?n thu\u7897?c c\f0\lang1033\'e1c ng\'e0nh, l\f1\u297?nh v\f2\lang1066\u7921?c quan tr\u7885?ng\par
D) V\f1\'e3n c\f0\lang1033\'f2n t\f1\u432? duy ph\f0\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n d\f0\lang1033\'e0n tr\f2\lang1066\u7843?i, thi\u7871?u tr\u7885?ng t\f0\lang1033\'e2m, tr\f2\lang1066\u7885?ng \f1\'f0i\f2\u7875?m\par
46. \f1\'d0\f0\lang1033\'e2u l\'e0 \f1\'f0i\f2\lang1066\u7873?u m\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1c UEHer, c\'e1 nh\'e2n ra v\'e0o UEH b\f2\lang1066\u7855?t bu\u7897?c ph\u7843?i th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i v\u7899?i kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng gian tr\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng h\u7885?c, \f1\'f0i\f2\u7873?u ki\u7879?n h\u7885?c t\u7853?p t\u7841?i tr\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?ng:\par
