\b0 47. C\f1\'e3n c\f2\lang1066\u7913? \f1\'d0i\f2\u7873?u 62, Lu\u7853?t Gi\f0\lang1033\'e1o d\f2\lang1066\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\u7885?c, ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i h\u7885?c \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c h\f1\u432?\f2\u7903?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch n\'e0o? \par
