55. \f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7875? th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n c\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh h\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?ng \ldblquote Quy ho\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050" c\f2\u7847?n th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n gi\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p v\f2\lang1066\u7873? c\f1\u417? ch\f2\u7871?, ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch n\'e0o sau \f1\'f0\f0\'e2y?\par
A) \f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7893?i m\u7899?i, n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c tuy\'ean truy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n, v\u7853?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng\par
B) X\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ho\'e0n thi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n th\u7875? ch\u7871?, ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch th\'fac \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7849?y c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c\par
\b C) \f1\u431?u ti\f0\lang1033\'ean \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7847?u t\f1\u432? m\f2\u7841?ng l\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?i h\u7841? t\u7847?ng quy m\f0\lang1033\'f4 l\f2\lang1066\u7899?n c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1c v\'f9ng \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897?ng l\u7921?c qu\u7889?c gia v\f0\lang1033\'e0 th\'fac \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7849?y h\f0\lang1033\'ecnh th\'e0nh c\'e1c h\'e0nh lang kinh t\f2\lang1066\u7871? \f1\u432?u\f0\lang1033  \f1\lang1066 ti\f0\lang1033\'ean\par
\b0 D) N\'e2ng cao ti\f2\lang1066\u7873?m l\u7921?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 tr\'ecnh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897? khoa h\u7885?c, c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ngh\f2\lang1066\u7879? trong n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7873? tri\u7875?n khai c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7899?ng nghi\f0\lang1033\'ean c\f2\lang1066\u7913?u khoa h\u7885?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ngh\f2\lang1066\u7879? m\u7899?i.\par
56. Ch\u7845?t n\f0\lang1033\'e0o sau \f1\'f0\f0\'e2y l\'e0 ch\f2\lang1066\u7845?t th\u7843?i kh\f0\lang1033\'f3 ph\'e2n h\f2\lang1066\u7911?y?\par
\b A) Gi\u7845?y nh\f0\lang1033\'f4m\par
\b0 B) Gi\f2\lang1066\u7845?y\par
