57. \f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7875? th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n c\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh h\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?ng \ldblquote Quy ho\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7871? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050" c\f2\u7847?n th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n gi\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p v\f2\lang1066\u7873? khoa h\u7885?c c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ngh\f2\lang1066\u7879? nh\f1\u432? th\f2\u7871? n\f0\lang1033\'e0o?\par
A) Quan t\'e2m c\'e1c khu v\f2\lang1066\u7921?c kh\f0\lang1033\'f3 kh\f1\'e3n, t\f2\lang1066\u7841?o \f1\'f0i\f2\u7873?u ki\u7879?n cho \f1\'f0\f2\u7891?ng b\f0\lang1033\'e0o d\'e2n t\f2\lang1066\u7897?c thi\u7875?u s\u7889?, khu v\u7921?c v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng kh\'f3 kh\f1\'e3n ti\f2\lang1066\u7871?p c\u7853?n b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7857?ng ngu\u7891?n l\u7921?c, c\f1\u417? h\f2\u7897?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n\par
B) \f1\'d0\f2\u7847?u t\f1\u432? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\'f4ng tr\'ecnh c\'f3 s\f2\lang1066\u7913?c lan t\u7887?a cao, gi\u7843?i quy\u7871?t c\f0\lang1033\'e1c n\'fat th\f2\lang1066\u7855?t c\u7911?a v\f0\lang1033\'f9ng, mang l\f2\lang1066\u7841?i hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? cho to\f0\lang1033\'e0n v\'f9ng\par
\b C) N\'e2ng cao ti\f2\lang1066\u7873?m l\u7921?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 tr\'ecnh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897? khoa h\u7885?c, c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ngh\f2\lang1066\u7879? trong n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? tri\u7875?n khai c\f0\lang1033\'e1c h\f1\u432?\u417?ng nghi\f0\'ean c\f2\lang1066\u7913?u khoa h\u7885?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ngh\f2\lang1066\u7879?\f0\lang1033  \f2\lang1066 m\u7899?i\par
\b0 D) \f1\'d0\f2\u7893?i m\u7899?i ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch thu h\'fat nh\'e2n l\f2\lang1066\u7921?c, \f1\'f0\f2\u7863?c bi\u7879?t l\f0\lang1033\'e0 c\'e1n b\f2\lang1066\u7897? khoa h\u7885?c k\u7929? thu\u7853?t v\u7873? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c l\'e2u d\'e0i\par
58. H\f2\lang1066\u7897?i ngh\u7883? l\u7847?n th\u7913? s\f0\lang1033\'e1u Ban Ch\f2\lang1066\u7845?p h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh Trung \f1\u432?\u417?ng \'d0\f2\lang1066\u7843?ng kh\f0\lang1033\'f3a XIII (10/2022), \f1\'f0\f0\'e3 th\'f4ng qua n\f2\lang1066\u7897?i dung n\f0\lang1033\'e0o trong c\'e1c n\f2\lang1066\u7897?i dung sau \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e2y?\par
 A) Ti\f2\lang1066\u7871?p t\u7909?c x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ho\'e0n thi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f1\u297?a Vi\f2\u7879?t Nam trong giai \f1\'f0o\f2\u7841?n m\u7899?i\par
B) Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7893?i m\u7899?i ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng th\f2\u7913?c l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7841?o, c\u7847?m quy\u7873?n c\u7911?a \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i v\u7899?i h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? trong giai \f1\'f0o\f2\u7841?n m\u7899?i\par
C) Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2030, t\f2\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2045 \par
\b D) T\f2\u7845?t c\u7843? n\u7897?i dung \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau\par
\b0 59. \f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7875? gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f2\lang1066\u7843?i, UEHers c\u7847?n\f0\lang1033  .......\f2\lang1066 tr\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c khi mua v\u7853?t d\u7909?ng m\u7899?i, \f1\'f0\f2\u7863?c bi\u7879?t l\f0\lang1033\'e0 trong nh\f2\lang1066\u7919?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7907?t khuy\u7871?n m\f0\lang1033\'e3i, si\'eau gi\f2\lang1066\u7843?m gi\f0\lang1033\'e1\f2\lang1066\par
A) Chu\u7849?n b\u7883? th\u7853?t nhi\u7873?u ti\u7873?n.\par
B) R\u7911? b\u7841?n b\f0\lang1033\'e8\par
\b C) C\'e2n nh\f2\lang1066\u7855?c k\u7929?\par
\b0 D) Mua nhi\u7873?u \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? d\f0\lang1033\'f9ng d\f2\lang1066\u7847?n\f0\lang1033\par
60. M\f2\lang1066\u7897?t trong nh\u7919?ng nh\f0\lang1033\'f3m nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f2\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t s\u7889? 28-NQ/TW, ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 17/11/2022 v\f2\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i m\u7899?i ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng th\f2\u7913?c l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7841?o, c\u7847?m quy\u7873?n c\u7911?a \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i v\u7899?i h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? trong giai \f1\'f0o\f2\u7841?n m\u7899?i\rdblquote , l\f0\lang1033\'e0...\par
A) C\'f4ng t\'e1c ki\f2\lang1066\u7871?m tra, gi\f0\lang1033\'e1m s\'e1t \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7847?y m\u7841?nh, g\f0\lang1033\'f3p ph\f2\lang1066\u7847?n si\u7871?t ch\u7863?t k\u7927? lu\u7853?t, k\u7927? c\f1\u432?\u417?ng trong \'d0\f2\u7843?ng.\par
B) Ph\u7843?i ch\u7911? \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng, t\f0\lang1033\'edch c\f2\lang1066\u7921?c, c\f0\lang1033\'f3 quy\f2\lang1066\u7871?t t\f0\lang1033\'e2m ch\'ednh tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? cao, \f1\'f0\f2\u7891?ng th\u7901?i c\u7847?n th\u7853?n tr\u7885?ng, c\f0\lang1033\'f3 b\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7899?c \f1\'f0i v\f2\u7919?ng ch\u7855?c.\par
\b C) Ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t huy vai tr\'f2, tr\'e1ch nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m n\f0\lang1033\'eau g\f1\u432?\u417?ng c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f2\lang1066\u7897?, \f1\'f0\f2\u7843?ng vi\f0\lang1033\'ean.\b0\par
D) Ph\f2\lang1066\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'f3 quy\f2\lang1066\u7871?t t\f0\lang1033\'e2m cao, n\f2\lang1066\u7895? l\u7921?c l\u7899?n trong t\u7893? ch\u7913?c th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n, t\u7841?o s\u7921? chuy\u7875?n bi\u7871?n m\u7841?nh m\u7869?, s\f0\lang1033\'e2u s\f2\lang1066\u7855?c v\u7873? \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i m\u7899?i ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng th\f2\u7913?c l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7841?o c\u7911?a \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng trong \f1\'f0i\f2\u7873?u ki\u7879?n m\u7899?i.\par
61. Gi\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p v\f2\lang1066\u7873? huy \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng ngu\u7891?n l\u7921?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n c\f0\lang1033\'e1c \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7883?nh h\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?ng \ldblquote Quy ho\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050" l\f0\lang1033\'e0 g\'ec?\par
A) N\'e2ng cao hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843? s\u7917? d\u7909?ng v\u7889?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7847?u t\f1\u432? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng, \f1\u432?u ti\f0\'ean cho m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng l\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?i h\u7841? t\u7847?ng quy m\f0\lang1033\'f4 l\f2\lang1066\u7899?n mang t\f0\lang1033\'ednh li\'ean v\'f9ng, li\'ean tinh, k\f2\lang1066\u7871?t n\u7889?i khu v\u7921?c, qu\u7889?c t\u7871?\par
B) Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\u7843?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch h\'e0nh ch\'ednh, n\'e2ng cao h\f1\u417?n n\f2\lang1066\u7919?a ch\u7845?t l\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?ng m\f0\lang1033\'f4i tr\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7847?u t\f1\u432? kinh doanh\par
C) \'d0\f2\u7893?i m\u7899?i m\u7841?nh m\u7869? ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch thu h\'fat \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7847?u t\u7915? n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c ngo\f0\lang1033\'e0i\par
\b D) T\f2\lang1066\u7845?t c\u7843? n\u7897?i dung \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau\b0\par
62. H\'e3y s\f2\lang1066\u7855?p x\u7871?p th\u7913? t\u7921? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c c\'e1ch \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7875? gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f2\lang1066\u7843?i thu\u7927? tinh:\par
\b A) [1] Tr\f0\lang1033\'e1nh mua \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7891? thu\u7927? tinh n\u7871?u kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'ecm \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c n\f1\u417?i x\f2\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd. [2] Tr\f2\lang1066\u7843? l\u7841?i n\f1\u417?i mua, ho\f2\u7863?c s\u7843?n xu\u7845?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? t\f0\lang1033\'e1i s\f2\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng. [3] T\u7853?n d\u7909?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0m c\'e1c v\f2\lang1066\u7853?t trang tr\f0\lang1033\'ed ho\f2\lang1066\u7863?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7921?ng th\u7921?c ph\u7849?m t\u7841?i nh\f0\lang1033\'e0.\b0\par
B) [1] Tr\f2\lang1066\u7843? l\u7841?i n\f1\u417?i mua, ho\f2\u7863?c s\u7843?n xu\u7845?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? t\f0\lang1033\'e1i s\f2\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng. [2] Tr\f0\lang1033\'e1nh mua \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7891? thu\u7927? tinh n\u7871?u kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'ecm \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c n\f1\u417?i x\f2\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd. [3] T\f2\lang1066\u7853?n d\u7909?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0m c\'e1c v\f2\lang1066\u7853?t trang tr\f0\lang1033\'ed ho\f2\lang1066\u7863?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7921?ng th\u7921?c ph\u7849?m t\u7841?i nh\f0\lang1033\'e0.\par
C) [1] Tr\'e1nh mua \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7891? thu\u7927? tinh n\u7871?u kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'ecm \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c n\f1\u417?i x\f2\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd. [2] T\f2\lang1066\u7853?n d\u7909?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0m c\'e1c v\f2\lang1066\u7853?t trang tr\f0\lang1033\'ed ho\f2\lang1066\u7863?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7921?ng th\u7921?c ph\u7849?m t\u7841?i nh\f0\lang1033\'e0. [3] Tr\f2\lang1066\u7843? l\u7841?i n\f1\u417?i mua, ho\f2\u7863?c s\u7843?n xu\u7845?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? t\f0\lang1033\'e1i s\f2\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng.\par
D) [1] T\u7853?n d\u7909?ng l\f0\lang1033\'e0m c\'e1c v\f2\lang1066\u7853?t trang tr\f0\lang1033\'ed ho\f2\lang1066\u7863?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7921?ng th\u7921?c ph\u7849?m t\u7841?i nh\f0\lang1033\'e0. [2] Tr\f2\lang1066\u7843? l\u7841?i n\f1\u417?i mua, ho\f2\u7863?c s\u7843?n xu\u7845?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? t\f0\lang1033\'e1i s\f2\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng. [3] Tr\f0\lang1033\'e1nh mua \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7891? thu\u7927? tinh n\u7871?u kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'ecm \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c n\f1\u417?i x\f2\u7917? l\f0\lang1033\'fd.\par
63. Ho\f2\lang1066\u7841?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng n\f0\lang1033\'e0o sau \f1\'f0\f0\'e2y kh\'f4ng n\f2\lang1066\u7857?m trong h\u7879? th\u7889?ng qu\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd ch\f2\lang1066\u7845?t th\u7843?i r\u7855?n:\par
A) Ch\f0\lang1033\'f4n l\f2\lang1066\u7845?p h\u7907?p v\u7879? sinh\par
