\b D) B\u7843?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7843?m quy\u7873?n l\f0\lang1033\'e0m ch\f2\lang1066\u7911? c\u7911?a Nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n d\'e2n, th\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?ng t\f0\lang1033\'f4n Hi\f2\lang1066\u7871?n ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p v\'e0 ph\'e1p lu\f2\lang1066\u7853?t, t\f0\lang1033\'f4n tr\f2\lang1066\u7885?ng, b\u7843?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7843?m v\f0\lang1033\'e0 b\f2\lang1066\u7843?o v\u7879? quy\u7873?n con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i, quy\u7873?n c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng d\'e2n\b0\par
131. Nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f2\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p th\f2\lang1066\u7913? t\f0\lang1033\'e1m c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t s\u7889? 27-NQ/TW, ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 9/11/2022 v\f2\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ho\'e0n thi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f1\u297?a Vi\f2\u7879?t Nam trong giai \f1\'f0o\f2\u7841?n m\u7899?i\rdblquote , l\f0\lang1033\'e0 g\'ec?\par
\b A) Ho\'e0n thi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n c\f1\u417? ch\f2\u7871? ki\u7875?m so\f0\lang1033\'e1t quy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n l\u7921?c nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7899?c, \f1\'f0\f2\u7847?y m\u7841?nh ph\f0\lang1033\'f2ng, ch\f2\lang1066\u7889?ng tham nh\f1\u361?ng, ti\f0\lang1033\'eau c\f2\lang1066\u7921?c\par
\b0 B) T\f1\'e3ng c\u432?\f2\u7901?ng s\u7921? l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7841?o c\u7911?a \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng, ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t huy vai tr\'f2 c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a M\u7863?t tr\u7853?n T\u7893? qu\u7889?c Vi\u7879?t Nam v\f0\lang1033\'e0 Nh\'e2n d\'e2n trong x\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng, ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n thi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f1\u297?a Vi\f2\u7879?t Nam\par
C) T\f1\'e3ng c\u432?\f2\u7901?ng, ch\u7911? \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng h\u7897?i nh\u7853?p qu\u7889?c t\u7871? \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1p \f2\lang1066\u7913?ng y\f0\lang1033\'eau c\f2\lang1066\u7847?u x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng, ho\f0\lang1033\'e0n thi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n Nh\f0\lang1033\'e0 n\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7899?c ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p quy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f1\u297?a Vi\f2\u7879?t Nam, x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 b\f2\lang1066\u7843?o v\u7879? T\u7893? qu\u7889?c trong t\f0\lang1033\'ecnh h\'ecnh m\f2\lang1066\u7899?i\par
D) X\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng n\u7873?n t\f1\u432? ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p chuy\'ean nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p, hi\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i, c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng b\f2\lang1066\u7857?ng, nghi\f0\lang1033\'eam minh, li\'eam ch\'ednh, ph\f2\lang1066\u7909?ng s\u7921? T\u7893? qu\u7889?c, ph\u7909?c v\u7909? Nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n d\'e2n\par
132. Ngh\f2\lang1066\u7883? quy\u7871?t s\u7889? 28-NQ/TW, ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 17/11/2022 v\f2\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7893?i m\u7899?i ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng th\f2\u7913?c l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7841?o, c\u7847?m quy\u7873?n c\u7911?a \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i v\u7899?i h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? trong giai \f1\'f0o\f2\u7841?n m\u7899?i", \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 t\f2\lang1066\u7893?ng k\u7871?t r\u7857?ng, sau 15 n\f1\'e3m th\f2\u7921?c hi\u7879?n Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t s\u7889? 15-NQ/TW ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 30/7/2007 c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a Ban Ch\u7845?p h\f0\lang1033\'e0nh Trung \f1\u432?\u417?ng\par
\b A) G\f0\'f3p ph\f2\lang1066\u7847?n quan tr\u7885?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0o vi\f2\lang1066\u7879?c n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao n\f1\'e3ng l\f2\lang1066\u7921?c c\u7847?m quy\u7873?n, b\u7843?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7843?m s\u7921? l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7841?o to\f0\lang1033\'e0n di\f2\lang1066\u7879?n, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\u7911?a \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng\b0\par
B) T\u7915?ng b\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c kh\u7855?c ph\u7909?c t\f0\lang1033\'ecnh tr\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng bao bi\u7879?n, l\f0\lang1033\'e0m thay ho\f2\lang1066\u7863?c bu\f0\lang1033\'f4ng l\f2\lang1066\u7887?ng vai tr\f0\lang1033\'f2 l\'e3nh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7841?o c\u7911?a \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng\par
C) Ch\u7845?t l\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?i ng\f1\u361? c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f2\lang1066\u7897? \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng l\'ean\par
D) Nh\f2\lang1066\u7853?n th\u7913?c, tr\f0\lang1033\'e1ch nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m c\u7911?a c\u7845?p \u7911?y, t\u7893? ch\u7913?c \f1\'f0\'e3ng \'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao\par
133. Nh\'f3m nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f2\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p th\f2\lang1066\u7913? ba c\u7911?a Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t 29-NQ/TW, ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 17/11/2022 v\f2\lang1066\u7873? "Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2030, t\f2\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2045\rdblquote , l\f0\lang1033\'e0 g\'ec?\par
A) \f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7893?i m\u7899?i t\f1\u432? duy, nh\f2\u7853?n th\u7913?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 h\'e0nh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897?ng quy\u7871?t li\u7879?t, ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c.\par
\b B) X\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng n\u7873?n c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p qu\u7889?c gia v\u7919?ng m\u7841?nh, t\u7921? l\u7921?c, t\u7921? c\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?ng; n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao n\f1\'e3ng l\f2\lang1066\u7921?c ng\f0\lang1033\'e0nh x\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng\b0\par
C) X\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ho\'e0n thi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n th\u7875? ch\u7871?, ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch th\'fac \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7849?y c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c\par
D) \f1\'d0\f2\u7849?y nhanh c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a n\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p, n\u7895?ng th\f0\lang1033\'f4n; ti\f2\lang1066\u7871?p t\u7909?c c\f1\u417? c\f2\u7845?u l\u7841?i ng\f0\lang1033\'e0nh d\f2\lang1066\u7883?ch v\u7909? d\u7921?a tr\f0\lang1033\'ean n\f2\lang1066\u7873?n t\u7843?ng khoa h\u7885?c - c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ngh\f2\lang1066\u7879?, \f1\'f0\f2\u7891?i m\u7899?i s\f0\lang1033\'e1ng t\f2\lang1066\u7841?o\par
134. Nh\f0\lang1033\'f3m nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f2\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p th\f2\lang1066\u7913? ba c\u7911?a Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t s\u7889? 28-NQ/TW, ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 17/11/2022 v\f2\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i m\u7899?i ph\f1\u432?\u417?ng th\f2\u7913?c l\f0\lang1033\'e3nh \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7841?o, c\u7847?m quy\u7873?n c\u7911?a \f1\'d0\f2\u7843?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i v\u7899?i h\u7879? th\u7889?ng ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? trong giai \f1\'f0o\f2\u7841?n m\u7899?i\rdblquote , l\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi?\par
\b A) \f1\'d0\f2\lang1066\u7889?i m\u7899?i, n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao ch\f2\lang1066\u7845?t l\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?ng, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c t\f2\lang1066\u7893? ch\u7913?c, c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f2\lang1066\u7897?\b0\par
B) \f1\'d0\f2\u7893?i m\u7899?i, n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c tuy\'ean truy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n, v\u7853?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng\par
C) \f1\'d0\f2\u7893?i m\u7899?i, n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao ch\f2\lang1066\u7845?t l\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?ng, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c ki\f2\lang1066\u7875?m tra, gi\f0\lang1033\'e1m s\'e1t\par
D) Ph\'e1t huy vai tr\'f2, tr\'e1ch nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m n\f0\lang1033\'eau g\f1\u432?\u417?ng c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f2\lang1066\u7897?, \f1\'f0\f2\u7843?ng vi\f0\lang1033\'ean\par
135. Nh\'f3m nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f2\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p th\f2\lang1066\u7913? b\u7843?y c\u7911?a Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t 29-NQ/TW, ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 17/11/2022 v\f2\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2030, t\f2\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2045", l\f0\lang1033\'e0 g\'ec?\par
A) Ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n khoa h\u7885?c - c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ngh\f2\lang1066\u7879?, \f1\'f0\f2\u7889?i m\u7899?i s\f0\lang1033\'e1ng t\f2\lang1066\u7841?o v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ngu\f2\lang1066\u7891?n nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n l\f2\lang1066\u7921?c ch\u7845?t l\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?ng cao \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e1p \f2\lang1066\u7913?ng y\f0\lang1033\'eau c\f2\lang1066\u7847?u c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a\par
\b B) Ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n c\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\'e0nh ph\f2\lang1066\u7847?n kinh t\u7871? nh\u7857?m th\f0\lang1033\'fac \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7849?y c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p ho\f0\lang1033\'e1, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i ho\f0\lang1033\'e1\b0\par
C) Ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n k\u7871?t c\u7845?u h\u7841? t\u7847?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7891?ng b\u7897?, hi\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i; th\f0\lang1033\'fac \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7849?y \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f4 th\f2\lang1066\u7883? h\f0\lang1033\'f3a nhanh v\'e0 b\f2\lang1066\u7873?n v\u7919?ng, g\u7855?n k\u7871?t ch\u7863?t ch\u7869? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f2\lang1066\u7841?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng l\u7921?c cho c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c\par
