D) Ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n k\u7871?t c\u7845?u h\u7841? t\u7847?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7891?ng b\u7897?, hi\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i; th\f0\lang1033\'fac \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7849?y \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f4 th\f2\lang1066\u7883? h\f0\lang1033\'f3a nhanh v\'e0 b\f2\lang1066\u7873?n v\u7919?ng, g\u7855?n k\u7871?t ch\u7863?t ch\u7869? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f2\lang1066\u7841?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng l\u7921?c cho c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c\par
142. Nh\u7919?ng nhi\u7879?m v\u7909? trong x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng, ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t huy gi\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? c\u7911?a v\f1\'e3n h\f0\lang1033\'f3a theo T\f1\u432? t\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7903?ng, \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7913?c, phong c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch H\f2\lang1066\u7891? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ed Minh l\'e0 g\'ec? \par
