A) \f1\'d0\f2\u7889?i m\u7899?i, n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c tuy\'ean truy\f2\lang1066\u7873?n, v\u7853?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng.\par
