\b C) \f1\'d0\f2\u7889?i m\u7899?i, n\f0\lang1033\'e2ng cao ch\f2\lang1066\u7845?t l\f1\u432?\f2\u7907?ng, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng t\'e1c ki\f2\lang1066\u7875?m tra, gi\f0\lang1033\'e1m s\'e1t \b0\par
D) Ph\'e1t huy vai tr\'f2, tr\'e1ch nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m n\f0\lang1033\'eau g\f1\u432?\u417?ng c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1n b\f2\lang1066\u7897?, \f1\'f0\f2\u7843?ng vi\f0\lang1033\'ean\par
144. Nh\f2\lang1066\u7919?ng nguy c\f1\u417? ti\f2\u7873?m \u7849?n khi s\u7917? d\u7909?ng Internet l\f0\lang1033\'e0 g\'ec?\par
