\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c v\f2\lang1066\u7845?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7873? \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau\b0\par
145. Nh\'f3m nhi\f2\lang1066\u7879?m v\u7909? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 gi\f2\lang1066\u7843?i ph\f0\lang1033\'e1p th\f2\lang1066\u7913? ch\f0\lang1033\'edn c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a Ngh\u7883? quy\u7871?t 29-NQ/TW, ng\f0\lang1033\'e0y 17/11/2022 v\f2\lang1066\u7873? \ldblquote Ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7849?y m\u7841?nh c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2030, t\f2\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2045, l\f0\lang1033\'e0 g\'ec ?\par
\b A) Qu\f2\lang1066\u7843?n l\f0\lang1033\'fd, s\f2\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng hi\u7879?u qu\u7843?, ti\u7871?t ki\u7879?m t\f0\lang1033\'e0i nguy\'ean, b\f2\lang1066\u7843?o v\u7879? m\f0\lang1033\'f4i tr\f1\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7901?ng, ch\u7911? \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng th\f0\lang1033\'edch \f2\lang1066\u7913?ng v\u7899?i bi\u7871?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7893?i kh\f0\lang1033\'ed h\f2\lang1066\u7853?u; t\f1\'e3ng c\u432?\f2\u7901?ng h\u7897?i nh\u7853?p qu\u7889?c t\u7871? s\f0\lang1033\'e2u r\f2\lang1066\u7897?ng, hi\u7879?u qu\u7843? \f1\'f0i \'f0\f0\lang1033\'f4i v\f2\lang1066\u7899?i b\u7843?o v\u7879? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n th\u7883? tr\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?ng trong n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c.\b0\par
B) Ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t huy gi\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? v\f1\'e3n h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, b\f2\lang1066\u7843?n l\f1\u297?nh, tr\f0\lang1033\'ed tu\f2\lang1066\u7879? con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i Vi\u7879?t Nam, x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng giai c\u7845?p c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nh\'e2n hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i, l\u7899?n m\u7841?nh; \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?i ng\f1\u361? tr\f0\lang1033\'ed th\f2\lang1066\u7913?c v\f0\lang1033\'e0 doanh nh\'e2n xung k\'edch, \f1\'f0i \'f0\f2\lang1066\u7847?u trong c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c; b\u7843?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7843?m t\u7889?t an sinh x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i\par
 C) \f1\'d0\f2\u7893?i m\u7899?i ch\f0\lang1033\'ednh s\'e1ch t\'e0i ch\'ednh, t\'edn d\f2\lang1066\u7909?ng th\f0\lang1033\'fac \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7849?y c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c nhanh, b\u7873?n v\u7919?ng\par
D) Ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n k\u7871?t c\u7845?u h\u7841? t\u7847?ng \f1\'f0\f2\u7891?ng b\u7897?, hi\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i; th\f0\lang1033\'fac \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7849?y \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f4 th\f2\lang1066\u7883? h\f0\lang1033\'f3a nhanh v\'e0 b\f2\lang1066\u7873?n v\u7919?ng, g\u7855?n k\u7871?t ch\u7863?t ch\u7869? v\f0\lang1033\'e0 t\f2\lang1066\u7841?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng l\u7921?c cho c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng nghi\f2\lang1066\u7879?p h\f0\lang1033\'f3a, hi\f2\lang1066\u7879?n \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i h\f0\lang1033\'f3a \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7845?t n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c.\par
146. N\u7897?i dung quan \f1\'f0i\f2\u7875?m c\u7911?a H\u7891? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ed Minh v\f2\lang1066\u7873? "m\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau x\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t huy gi\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i"\par
A) x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t huy gi\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i ph\u7843?i t\u7853?p trung \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e0o t\f2\lang1066\u7841?o nh\u7919?ng con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i c\f0\lang1033\'f3 \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7841?o \f1\'f0\f2\u7913?c c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng\par
B) x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t huy gi\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i ph\u7843?i t\u7841?o ra nh\u7919?ng con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i c\f0\lang1033\'f3 \'fd ch\f2\lang1066\u7881?, c\u7847?u ti\u7871?n, kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng ng\f2\lang1066\u7915?ng v\f1\u432?\u417?n l\f0\lang1033\'ean l\'e0m ch\f2\lang1066\u7911? nh\u7919?ng ki\u7871?n th\u7913?c khoa h\u7885?c, nh\u7919?ng hi\u7875?u bi\u7871?t v\u7873? th\u7901?i \f1\'f0\f2\u7841?i\par
C) x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng v\f0\lang1033\'e0 ph\'e1t huy gi\'e1 tr\f2\lang1066\u7883? con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i ph\u7843?i t\u7841?o n\f0\lang1033\'ean nh\f2\lang1066\u7919?ng con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i c\f0\lang1033\'f3 tinh th\f2\lang1066\u7847?n t\f0\lang1033\'ecm t\'f2i s\'e1ng t\f2\lang1066\u7841?o, c\f0\lang1033\'f3 quy\f2\lang1066\u7871?t t\f0\lang1033\'e2m, nh\f2\lang1066\u7841?y b\f0\lang1033\'e9n v\f2\lang1066\u7899?i c\f0\lang1033\'e1i m\f2\lang1066\u7899?i, bi\u7871?t v\u7853?n d\u7909?ng n\f0\lang1033\'f3 v\'e0o th\f2\lang1066\u7921?c ti\u7877?n cu\u7897?c s\u7889?ng\par
\b D) T\u7845?t c\u7843? c\f0\lang1033\'e1c n\f2\lang1066\u7897?i dung \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'e3 n\'eau\b0\par
147. N\f2\lang1066\u7897?i dung quan \f1\'f0i\f2\u7875?m c\u7911?a H\u7891? Ch\f0\lang1033\'ed Minh v\f2\lang1066\u7873? "x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i ch\u7911? ngh\f1\u297?a l\f0\lang1033\'e0 y\'eau c\f2\lang1066\u7847?u kh\f0\lang1033\'e1ch quan, v\f2\lang1066\u7915?a c\u7845?p b\f0\lang1033\'e1ch, v\f2\lang1066\u7915?a l\f0\lang1033\'e2u d\'e0i c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng"\par
\b A) con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i ph\u7843?i \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c \f1\'f0\f2\u7863?t v\f0\lang1033\'e0o v\f2\lang1066\u7883? tr\f0\lang1033\'ed trung t\'e2m c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a s\u7921? ph\f0\lang1033\'e1t tri\f2\lang1066\u7875?n\b0\par
B) con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i l\f0\lang1033\'e0 v\f2\lang1066\u7889?n qu\f0\lang1033\'fd nh\f2\lang1066\u7845?t, nh\f0\lang1033\'e2n t\f2\lang1066\u7889? quy\u7871?t \f1\'f0\f2\u7883?nh th\f0\lang1033\'e0nh c\'f4ng c\f2\lang1066\u7911?a s\u7921? nghi\u7879?p c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng\par
C) con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i v\u7915?a l\f0\lang1033\'e0 m\f2\lang1066\u7909?c ti\f0\lang1033\'eau, v\f2\lang1066\u7915?a l\f0\lang1033\'e0 \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7897?ng l\u7921?c c\u7911?a c\f0\lang1033\'e1ch m\f2\lang1066\u7841?ng\par
D) b\u7843?n ch\u7845?t con ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i mang b\u7843?n ch\u7845?t x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i, l\f0\lang1033\'e0 s\f2\lang1066\u7843?n ph\u7849?m c\u7911?a x\f0\lang1033\'e3 h\f2\lang1066\u7897?i\par
148. \u7902? Vi\u7879?t Nam, trung b\f0\lang1033\'ecnh m\f2\lang1066\u7895?i m\u7897?t ng\f1\u432?\f2\u7901?i d\f0\lang1033\'e2n th\f2\lang1066\u7843?i ra 41kg r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f2\lang1066\u7843?i nh\u7921?a m\u7895?i n\f1\'e3m, v\f2\u7853?y UEHer n\f0\lang1033\'ean l\'e0m g\'ec \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7875? gi\u7843?m thi\u7875?u r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f2\lang1066\u7843?i?\par
A) Trang b\u7883? t\f0\lang1033\'fai s\f2\lang1066\u7917? d\u7909?ng \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\u7907?c nhi\u7873?u l\u7847?n khi \f1\'f0i mua s\f2\u7855?m (t\f0\lang1033\'fai v\f2\lang1066\u7843?i, t\f0\lang1033\'fai gi\f2\lang1066\u7845?y, t\f0\lang1033\'fai nh\f2\lang1066\u7921?a s\u7917? d\u7909?ng nhi\u7873?u l\u7847?n...);\par
B) S\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\f0\lang1033\'e1c lo\f2\lang1066\u7841?i v\u7853?t d\f0\lang1033\'f9ng nhi\f2\lang1066\u7873?u l\u7847?n c\f0\lang1033\'f3 kh\f2\lang1066\u7843? n\f1\'e3ng t\f0\lang1033\'e1i l\'e0m \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7847?y nh\u7919? binh n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c, ly n\f1\u432?\f2\u7899?c UEH \f1\'f0\f2\u7875? h\u7841?n ch\u7871? r\f0\lang1033\'e1c th\f2\lang1066\u7843?i nh\u7921?a m\u7897?t\f0\lang1033  l\f2\lang1066\u7847?\f0\lang1033 n\par
