\b0 B) Th\f2\lang1066\u7921?c hi\u7879?n t\u7889?t nguy\f0\lang1033\'ean t\f2\lang1066\u7855?c c\f0\lang1033\'f4ng d\'e2n \f1\'f0\u432?\f2\lang1066\u7907?c l\f0\lang1033\'e0m t\f2\lang1066\u7845?t c\u7843? nh\u7919?ng g\f0\lang1033\'ec ph\'e1p lu\f2\lang1066\u7853?t kh\f0\lang1033\'f4ng c\f2\lang1066\u7845?m\par
