D) X\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng n\u7873?n kinh t\u7871? \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?c l\u7853?p, t\u7921? ch\u7911?, ch\u7911? \f1\'f0\f2\u7897?ng, t\f0\lang1033\'edch c\f2\lang1066\u7921?c h\u7897?i nh\u7853?p qu\u7889?c t\u7871? s\f0\lang1033\'e2u r\f2\lang1066\u7897?ng\par
188. Vi\u7879?c x\f0\lang1033\'e2y d\f2\lang1066\u7921?ng \ldblquote Quy ho\u7841?ch t\u7893?ng th\u7875? qu\u7889?c gia th\u7901?i k\u7923? 2021 - 2030, t\u7847?m nh\f0\lang1033\'ecn \f1\'f0\f2\lang1066\u7871?n n\f1\'e3m 2050" d\f2\u7921?a tr\f0\lang1033\'ean 5 nh\'f3m nguy\'ean t\f2\lang1066\u7855?c, quan \f1\'f0i\f2\u7875?m, m\u7897?t trong s\u7889? \f1\'f0\f0\lang1033\'f3 l\'e0 gi?\par
